    <abstract>
      <para>A checklist of all extant lineages of Isoptera (termites): Latin scientific names paired with Chinese standard names. It covers 13 families, 18 subfamilies, 326 genera, 3021 species and 68 subspecies (3089 taxon records). Each record gives the scientific name, authorship, Chinese name, rank (species/subspecies), full classification (clade-family-subfamily-genus, in Latin and Chinese), type-species flag, type locality, distribution (Chinese and English), and synonyms with their type localities. The data are provided as a structured JSON taxonomy tree, a flat one-row-per-taxon CSV, a long-format synonym table, and a reference list of 77 cited works (DOIs where available). The dataset is a taxonomic compilation for look-up, cross-checking, translation and biodiversity informatics. It makes no nomenclatural act; new taxa and nomenclatural changes must be cited from the original publications.</para>
    </abstract>
